NOTE ON BUNDLED CONTENT

The MIT license above covers the source code of this project only.

This repository and the installer it produces also contain material that is
NOT covered by it and NOT owned by the copyright holder:

  * Icons, artwork, species names and descriptions originating from Palworld,
    which are the property of Pocketpair, Inc. They are included so the tool can
    show the game's own symbols for the player's own save data. No affiliation
    with or endorsement by Pocketpair is claimed or implied.
  * tools/libooz.dll, built from https://github.com/zao/ooz — an independent
    implementation of the Oodle Kraken decompressor, needed because Palworld
    compresses its saves with it.

Third-party components used under their own licenses:

  * palworld-save-tools (MIT) — save parsing
  * Node.js (MIT) — bundled runtime in the installer
  * M PLUS Rounded 1c and Zen Kaku Gothic New (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  * Species, breeding and passive metadata derived from
    https://github.com/oMaN-Rod/palworld-save-pal
